WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.280
We categorize choking into two levels based on how much air is getting through.

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:10.560
In a mild choking situation, the person is still able to move some air in and

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:15.360
out of their lungs. You will usually see them coughing forcefully and they might

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:20.920
even be able to speak or cry briefly. The best thing you can do here is stay calm

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:25.959
and encourage them to keep coughing as hard as they can to expel the item. You

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:30.600
want to let their body do the work. However, stay close and watch them

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:35.439
carefully because if that forceful coughing fails and the blockage stays

00:00:35.439 --> 00:00:40.599
put, it can quickly turn into severe choking.

